  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n      - Added `IsLoopBack` option for servers.\n      - Added smart `Session.Address` resolution:\n      - Loopback: uses forwarded header when available, otherwise falls back to remote IP or `0.0.0.0`.\n      - Non-loopback: uses remote IP, falling back to `0.0.0.0`.\n      - Added server/manager lifecycle console command aliases (`sa`, `xa`, `ra`, `ss`, `xs`, `rs`, `sm`, `xm`, `rm`) while preserving backward compatibility.",
